{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16983","headline":"和杨弘微春日曲江南望 · 武元衡","name":"和杨弘微春日曲江南望","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"迟景霭悠悠，伤春南陌头。\n暄风一澹荡，遐思几殷忧。\n龙去空仙沼，鸾飞掩妓楼。\n芳菲余雨露，冠盖旧公侯。\n朱戟千门闭，黄鹂百啭愁。\n烟蒙宫树晚，花咽石泉流。\n寒谷律潜应，中林兰自幽。\n商山将避汉，晋室正藩周。\n黍稷闻兴叹，琼瑶畏见投。\n君心即吾事，微向在沧洲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"武元衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_16983.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_16983","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}